    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d844">

                <pb facs="0840" n="674" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg674"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.5914/139</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Danish Minister </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-09-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 8, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The treaty which was signed in New York ceding the Danish West Indies to the
                    United States was ratified by the Senate last night by a majority of about six
                    to one. No modification was made in the text of the treaty.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
